Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.91 / Widget Demo / 2026-11-24
240x536 RGB565; automatic raw-input and virtual-clock benchmark; async ping-pong QSPI DMA.
sample=5: glass on; sample=6: glass off. Both rotate the same card from front to back.
16 virtual steps, 40 ms apart per turn. elapsed_us counts wall-clock Engine advance and present.
With async ping-pong DMA (`WIRE: [[u16; WORDS]; 2]` + `board_flush`), transfer_us accumulates
in-flight window time between queueing band N and syncing band N+1 (overlapping CPU render).
Panel emission latency was not measured.
